{"id":2743,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>3月29日，我院同环境与安全工程学院在环境与安全工程学院院楼一层会议室联合举办明德讲坛。本次讲坛以读书分享会为载体，特邀六位研究生担任主讲，融合专业阅读与主题宣讲，为两院学子带来了一场精彩的思想交流盛宴。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MUllo4LNCiUmrRMuzlYUlQfMR9YnN7UZnlUDL8QVo7MRM7-0gihFp2hmCIa0LShRMkyiL1h7Mz7ZUmAfUlLbL4W2UNL4MmUbUzUPL7UZUmfFUNQVnRWfL4rFMzG4ozGJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDLRlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6605&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1C452D518B8AAC932FBC3649A410D8B0/BFED2A35/50390\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 530px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ML8CobUzWVMmMfUulCaLmV7L7laLzNUZnR-sM8-Yol7PL870gihFp2hmCIa0LYhfLYhRnShRM4VkLlCsLNCDUNnkUzCiUNLsUzUsLR94UNnFUzMVnl7so7rFMR-iM8-ZgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDMmGigtA8pUncc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6605&e=.jpg\"></p><p>活动中，四位同学依次开展读书分享，立足专业所学与阅读体悟，解读经典著作与学术书籍，梳理核心内容、剖析理论精髓，结合科研经历与社会热点分享所思所悟，为同学们提供了全新的阅读与思考视角。此外，我院知行宣讲团两位成员带来主题宣讲，聚焦美丽中国建设与生态文明发展，传递青年担当。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MozvoiMmA2MNQfUuzvZolUiUzAVU4AUVnR-YnN7sMm7DM490gihFp2hmCIa0nShfokyPoShfM4V2LzGYoRLYUm7PMRLaUzVRLzL4nlUZUmVFL878LRQVUzWFMz-ZL7-Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDLRlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6605&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EA819A71F102832B11430A1C133ED8B1/3A406EA2/5280B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 551px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MLRWofMmVVMRTfLum-anmLsL8lZMRUUsMmUYUNQkUmn2LlU0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhkMYysMSyPU4WRo7QVL8UZMzrRMmrRnzNsnRLiM4NYL8nFnl-8L7VfUzTFn7nVL4MRgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDMmGigtA8pUncc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6605&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次明德讲坛将读书分享与专业实践、家国情怀相结合，既丰富了两院研究生的学术文化生活，又深化了学子对专业使命与时代责任的认知，营造了浓厚的阅读与学术交流氛围，助力青年学子以学促行，以专业力量助力时代发展。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MnR-oPL4v8M4AVMumCDoznfLlMkoRnU2UzNDMzrkMml4M4l0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRL1hVMkhkoRWknmVkolrVnm9PMRLiMNMfLRWVM8rVMRrFnzGZL8QfLRVFM7CiM4GJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDLRlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6605&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BC2E4B82BF1B9EEF814356CA02E7EE45/E083FA01/4F570\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 548px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MMz-oiLmfVM7-8Mu467Mmn2LzW2nmvUsozT2n7WkLlCsozl0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhfM1h2MSybMNCaMllPMlUaUm9bM46kLmf2U4UZoR-4MNnFM4Q7MllbL7WFL4T2L7n7gtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDMmGigtA8pUncc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6605&e=.jpg\"></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MUllo4LNCiUmrRMuzlYUlQfMR9YnN7UZnlUDL8QVo7MRM7-0gihFp2hmCIa0LShRMkyiL1h7Mz7ZUmAfUlLbL4W2UNL4MmUbUzUPL7UZUmfFUNQVnRWfL4rFMzG4ozGJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDLRlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6605&e=.jpg"}